================================================================================
Independence and provenance
================================================================================

Luma is an independent, community project. It is not affiliated with, authorized
by, or endorsed by Humane Inc. or HP Inc. It is an original reimplementation
written for interoperability with Humane Ai Pin hardware that its owners lawfully
possess, created after the original Humane cloud service was permanently shut
down on 28 February 2025.

Luma contains no Humane source code, firmware, binaries, APKs, fonts, images, or
design assets. Where names from the original system appear in this repository —
the `humane.*` gRPC package, service, and method names; Android package
identities; the device's own `Build` manufacturer and model strings; and the
`humane.center/share/...` link path — they appear only because an unmodified Pin
requires them byte-for-byte to interoperate. They are interface and compatibility
identifiers, not a claim of origin, source, or endorsement. See TRADEMARKS.md.

Center delegates the Pin's WebUSB ADB authorization to PenumbraOS's remote
signing service; Luma bundles no ADB private key or certificate of its own.

The `.proto` interface definitions in this repository were written from the
observable gRPC wire protocol for the sole purpose of interoperability. The
decompiled stock applications are kept entirely outside the repository and are
never committed (see CONTRIBUTING.md and AGENTS.md).

